n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- A midstream Milvus repository exists under opendatahub-io, tracking the\n55\t  selected upstream Milvus release.\n56\t- The repository's branching and sync conventions match those of other\n57\t  opendatahub-io midstream repositories.\n58\t- The repository baseline is reproducible: the exact upstream version and any\n59\t  midstream patches applied are recorded.\n60\t\n61\t## HLR Traceability\n62\t\n63\t- HLR-2 (P0, managed path): administrators can deploy the managed vector\n64\t  store with productized images — this epic provides the repository those\n65\t  images are built from.\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90d5cd45208e6cee","agent_id":"a61f4abe16c2b3c47","session_id":"456aa445-a015-4ed6-b66f-fb5c63ab7c74","uuid":"9bf030f2-1fbd-4ffb-8d23-e46ebcef88a5","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:07:36.890Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-861f11dfa6311926","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Second revision of RHAISTRAT-9007"}
