{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c670cea9cd78122","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E005\n3\ttitle: Platform Operator deployment and lifecycle for managed Milvus\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9007\n5\tcomponent: Platform Operator\n6\tteam: ODH Platform\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tbranch: A\n10\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n11\tdependencies:\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n13\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E003\n14\tgate_failure_impact:\n15\t  action: remove\n16\t  fallback_approach: If the external-connection-only posture is selected, no operator-deployed\n17\t    vector store is built and this epic is removed.\n18\tai_signals:\n19\t  change_specificity: 0\n20\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n21\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n22\t  existing_foundation: 1\n23\t  open_questions: 0\n24\t  external_dependency: 0\n25\t  human_process_gates: 0\n26\t  repo_access: 1\n27\t  architecture_claims: -1\n28\timplementation_type: null\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: Medium\n31\tai_implementability_score: 2\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Platform Operator deployment and lifecycle for managed Milvus\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tThis epic delivers the core of the managed posture: administrators can deploy\n39\tthe platform-managed vector store (Milvus) through the Platform Operator,\n40\tusing the productized image, with platform-supported lifecycle. It is the\n41\tgeneral implementation of the onboarding chain — it runs after license\n42\tvalidation and in parallel with the Konflux build-pipeline onboarding.\n43\t\n44\t## Scope\n45\t\n46\t- Extend the Platform Operator so an administrator can deploy the managed\n47\t  Milvus vector store as a platform resource, referencing the productized\n48\t  Milvus image.\n49\t- Implement lifecycle handling for the managed vector store (deployment,\n50\t  status reporting, upgrade, and removal) at the level the platform provides\n51\t  for other operator-managed components.\n52\t- Surface deployment status through the operator's standard status\n53\t  conditions so consuming components and the Dashboard can observe it.\n54\t- Confirm the Platform Operator's ownership and extension surface with the\n55\t  owning team before starting — the Platform Operator has no\n56\t  architecture-context file in the platform inventory (see decomposition\n57\t  health warnings).\n58\t\n59\t## Acceptance Criteria\n60\t\n61\t- An administrator can deploy the managed Milvus vector store through the\n62\t  Platform Operator, and the deployment reports ready status.\n63\t- The deployment uses the productized Milvus image (pinned digest available\n64\t  at deployment time) rather than an ad-hoc upstream image reference.\n65\t- Lifecycle operations (upgrade, removal) are available for the managed\n66\t  vector store and leave the cluster in a consistent state.\n67\t- The build pipeline for the changed operator code is green (the Konflux\n68\t  onboarding in this strategy's dependency chain gates first execution, not\n69\t  this epic's start).\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-2 (P0, managed path): administrators can deploy the managed vector\n74\t  store through the Platform Operator with productized images.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90d5cd45208e6cee","agent_id":"a61f4abe16c2b3c47","session_id":"456aa445-a015-4ed6-b66f-fb5c63ab7c74","uuid":"db289f57-c095-48da-9cee-c28fdbbb8114","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:07:37.624Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c670cea9cd78122","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Second revision of RHAISTRAT-9007"}
