upgrade, removal).\n52\t- Follow the Dashboard's existing per-component feature flag and defaults\n53\t  mechanism for enabling the managed vector store surface.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- An administrator can deploy the managed vector store from the Dashboard and\n58\t  see its readiness status in the console.\n59\t- Management operations available in the console reflect the lifecycle\n60\t  supported by the operator, with no data-plane logic implemented in the\n61\t  Dashboard.\n62\t- The surface is gated by the Dashboard's standard feature flag mechanism.\n63\t\n64\t## HLR Traceability\n65\t\n66\t- HLR-4 (P1, managed path): the Dashboard exposes a deploy-and-manage UI for\n67\t  the managed vector store.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b32aebbc0fc9bcf2","agent_id":"af8f91c729ee13d90","session_id":"456aa445-a015-4ed6-b66f-fb5c63ab7c74","uuid":"dcee0236-aebd-44c3-9949-efc95fd7ace1","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:10:03.432Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ed01f6f91c4138d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Final review of RHAISTRAT-9007"}
